<menuchoice>
<guimenu
>File</guimenu>
<guimenuitem
>Use Current Slide as Default Template</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice>
</term>
<listitem>
<para
><action
>Sets the current slide as your default template</action
>.
Especially useful if you have created a template of your own to fit into
